6241a362f05">吞没而去</text><text for="line-166c82a9-84d2-4a16-a6cf-b73c5373df6d">将滋滋作响 熊熊燃烧的</text><text for="line-5c3f18a4-8f69-4094-a6cd-33da31e8d7b5">脉动之激情抑制</text><text for="line-416d2ca9-f1f8-406e-9647-c3249a767b88">连无数夜晚与数千繁星</text><text for="line-7f668fa8-d8b2-4495-8742-6bc0026451d0">全都贯穿抹去</text><text for="line-16d9640d-1270-4b92-a835-8146c61f040d">生命 虚幻无常</text><text for="line-087d2613-6fd0-4cf0-abfe-fd0a326ab1de">终归是消散的命运的话</text><text for="line-457b53e9-d351-4e87-91eb-3e66016b7471">现在 将这具躯体</text><text for="line-7b4b531a-a432-4d26-b1f9-e6ed69daae39">生命 如此顽强</text><text for="line-2663d90d-f8c8-4cae-9ce6-027e1a401c48">若由神明决定胜负的话</text><text for="line-092a41f0-0784-446e-9dc4-dcd0233653a4">那就连那神明的眼泪也化作食粮</text><text for="line-57516288-cd2b-480b-8b84-eca4f592193d">绽放出硕大的花朵就好</text><text for="line-5d68c083-5f81-4ed4-8c35-bb06e86b6197">开辟未知</text><text for="line-6aa244bb-3012-43bd-b344-f9104d6d7e2f">一步步迈步向前</text><text for="line-4649c43c-897c-4226-9c12-140f1e6590b0">向着无法抗拒的明天</text><text for="line-280fb7cf-dcdf-433c-b4bd-1c37f9c52a3b">挺身面对</text><text for="line-701c78a0-f62d-4aa1-a97a-c4ed2d75752c">将沙沙作响 随风飘动的</text><text for="line-75a536d2-aeae-4e00-b0e4-c6eea43a847e">颤动的发丝束起</text><text for="line-914d7b85-c52e-43e1-a63f-0f656f62137f">在这心中回响的是</text><text for="line-5a85c4bc-4480-4bb2-a97f-7885edb25841">佚名的吟咏者的声音</text><text for="line-9c8a49cd-634b-41f4-8959-4e7d7aa1d761">希望 让人神往</text><text for="line-4f380d73-c1ac-4a38-a3a8-3075544afb47">想要托付于这双手臂</text><text for="line-144b4e75-d3c6-4aad-b8f4-05ce4850358a">蓝草 若相交融</text><text for="line-7f25ff61-4fc7-49fd-9cbf-a16b0b9c1e4e">泪水 纵有一行</text><text for="line-13d08e83-d919-4e51-8dfa-23435d774c89">顺着脸颊滑落也罢</text><text for="line-9b0bbd64-7778-425c-8a99-ab07fe1befcc">在最后的终局闪耀生命吧</text><text for="line-8badd378-8d17-4c56-9817-de9937f95f20">直到那滴水珠 触及大地为止</text><text for="line-1f429902-1748-48ff-b514-3bd568ff5bbc">将滋滋作响 熊熊燃烧的</text><text for="line-f4be157b-fbb8-4f4f-91d5-d01b123b8b46">脉动之激情抑制</text><text for="line-6d818d44-2d49-4ab2-bb09-4eeac79ca5aa">连无数夜晚与数千繁星</text><text for="line-4684e98a-d6e0-4a14-9dde-3641329a2b69">全都贯穿抹去</text><text for="line-45e40625-ed40-4e65-94b1-7319937e4996">生命 虚幻无常</text><text for="line-e2ecb2d9-15d8-43d6-ac19-b6736efbda4a">终归是消散的命运的话</text><text for="line-754c7a93-5bf1-4d94-b7de-00824a6b62ee">现在 将这具躯体</text><text for="line-a354050c-0a41-433f-b21e-58639fc10e6d">生命 如此顽强</text><text for="line-7bc90aa1-5ea2-423b-9eda-9ecf6b5cccd4">若由神明决定胜负的话</text><text for="line-c871c5be-9d70-4703-8cf6-af57e1709171">那就连那神明的眼泪也化作食粮</text><text for="line-6b8c60af-c317-4948-83f9-5ec78263b6be">绽放出硕大的花朵就好</text><text for="line-6b8c60af-c317-4948-83f9-5ec78263b6be"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-118aca32-c50f-4a83-b69f-3573b0a0da13">(简直就像烟花一般)</span></text><text for="line-6b8c60af-c317-4948-83f9-5ec78263b6be"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-9044c208-7109-4027-a98a-c395aeec5ecd">(简直就像烟花一般)</span></text><text for="line-0dcf118f-cb9b-4f24-b862-2f14f488c82b">生命 虚幻无常</text><text for="a245876f-347d-47bf-9f1e-b1899cd764ec">传闻人就是如此前行</text><text for="23addf65-f65c-46ec-b057-c7fe8f4fc869">全部赌上一试便是</text><text for="7e001a7e-8c5b-4023-b7f0-502b28ab7362">怀着的那份意志</text><text for="6ba0d7d8-c200-4aa2-82a2-8766acfd214e">便会一点点染作蔚蓝</text><text for="a1ba2246-29c9-47a9-ac3d-9d40663082df">全部赌上一试便是</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:14.540"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-0dcf118f-cb9b-4f24-b862-2f14f488c82b" itunes:key="line-0dcf118f-cb9b-4f24-b862-2f14f488c82b" begin="00:00.603" end="00:03.323" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:00.603" end="00:01.827" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:00.603" end="00:01.023">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.023" end="00:01.363">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.363" end="00:01.827">ち</span></span></span> <span begin="00:01.923" end="00:02.763" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">儚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.923" end="00:02.363">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.363" end="00:02.563">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.563" end="00:02.763">な</span></span></span><span begin="00:02.763" end="00:02.963">く</span><span begin="00:02.963" end="00:03.323">て</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-e4570481-cff3-476e-a997-7ad443f2913f" itunes:key="line-e4570481-cff3-476e-a997-7ad443f2913f" begin="00:03.543" end="00:08.843" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:03.543" end="00:03.783">ど</span><span begin="00:03.783" end="00:03.923">う</span><span begin="00:03.923" end="00:04.103">せ</span><span begin="00:04.103" end="00:04.323" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">散</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:04.103" end="00:04.323">ち</span></span></span><span begin="00:04.323" end="00:04.523">り</span><span begin="00:04.523" end="00:04.889" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:04.523" end="00:04.889">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:04.889" end="00:05.063">く</span><span begin="00:05.063" end="00:06.243" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:05.063" end="00:05.503">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:05.503" end="00:05.903">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:05.903" end="00:06.243">め</span></span></span><span begin="00:06.243" end="00:06.683">な</span><span begin="00:06.683" end="00:08.843">ら</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-b07510dc-7bb4-464c-928a-44dd8d37ea47" itunes:key="line-b07510dc-7bb4-464c-928a-44dd8d37ea47" begin="00:22.517" end="00:28.377" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:22.517" end="00:23.317" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:22.517" end="00:22.937">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:22.937" end="00:23.317">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:23.317" end="00:23.837">は</span><span begin="00:23.837" end="00:24.908" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幻</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:23.837" end="00:24.317">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.317" end="00:24.517">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.517" end="00:24.677">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.677" end="00:24.908">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:24.908" end="00:25.337">を</span><span begin="00:25.637" end="00:26.097">そ</span><span begin="00:26.097" end="00:26.448">の</span><span begin="00:26.448" end="00:27.437" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.448" end="00:27.077">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.077" end="00:27.437">ね</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.437" end="00:27.649">に</span><span begin="00:27.649" end="00:28.057" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.649" end="00:27.837">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.837" end="00:28.057">だ</span></span></span><span begin="00:28.057" end="00:28.377">き</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-e172f86d-759b-4513-ae53-488f268372ce" itunes:key="line-e172f86d-759b-4513-ae53-488f268372ce" begin="00:28.837" end="00:33.117" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:28.837" end="00:29.657" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.837" end="00:29.237">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.237" end="00:29.657">も</span></span></span><span begin="00:29.657" end="00:30.017">い</span><span begin="00:30.017" end="00:30.210" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text"